{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"77180","name":"Hotel Capannelle","description":"'Hotel Capannelle is located in Rome's historic Statuario district, just 1 km from the Capannelle Racecourse and 3 km from the Cinecittà and Colli Albani metro stations on Line A, providing easy access to the historic center and the Vatican. With Ciampino Airport only 5 km away, it's ideal for business trips or weekend getaways. Guests can enjoy views of the Parco degli Acquedotti and the Ancient Appian Way Park, home to the historic Villa dei Quintili, from the hotel terraces. The park offers fascinating routes rich in archaeological and artistic sites, leading to the heart of Imperial Rome. The hotel features 252 rooms, including six suites and 14 accessible rooms. All rooms are equipped with air conditioning, Wi-Fi, a safe, and a TV. The hotel also boasts ample parking and an outdoor swimming pool (open during summer, with a fee payable at the hotel). Ten versatile meeting rooms accommodate small business meetings and large conventions of up to 450 people, making Hotel Capannelle a perfect venue for any event. '","address":"Siderno, 37","city":"ROMA","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00178","lat":41.83568,"lng":12.55469,"stars":4,"giataCode":"82453","phone":"+390698379867","email":"booking@romanhotels.it","website":"http://www.hotelcapannelle.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077180/077180a_hb_ro_013.jpg","roomCode":"DBT.ST","category":"room","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077180/077180a_hb_a_008.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077180/077180a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077180/077180a_hb_a_007.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/07/077180/077180a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/